Task: Backend API Validation for Event Project Period

Why:
Ensure that events (single and recurring) cannot be linked to projects if their dates fall outside the project timeframe, while allowing linkings if project dates are null (unbounded).

Summary of Changes:
- ProjetoVincularPolicy: Skip validation if project start/end dates are null. Added validateRecurrence method to validate all recurring event occurrences.
- CreateEventoUseCase & UpdateEventoUseCase: Integrate the validateLink and validateRecurrence logic into event creation and update lifecycles.
- CreateEventoRecorrenciaUseCase: Integrate validateRecurrence logic to reject rule registration if occurrences exceed project boundaries.
- VinculoProjetoEventoIntegrationTest: Updated to use seeded organization to prevent referential integrity errors and added integration test cases for single and recurring events (validating start, end, limits, and exceptions).

